 R←Test_API_034(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;rc;msg;res
⍝ Runs "Repack" from APL. It used to take `(folder args)` and call `args.Switch`, so it could not
⍝ be called without fabricating a user command argument - although it is in `Public` and has an
⍝ API cover. It now takes the folder, with an optional `(window depth)` as ⍺.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 (##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/CiderProject4.zip')ZipArchive.UnzipTo tempDir

 res←G.Repack tempDir                   ⍝ Defaults
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≡,res
 →T.GoToTidyUp~FilesAndDirs.IsDir tempDir,'/.git'

 res←(10 50)G.Repack tempDir            ⍝ Window and depth given explicitly
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≡,res
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢0 1 G.Status tempDir  ⍝ The repository is still intact and clean

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
